@startuml
title JeryMotro — Déploiement GCP Debian 13

cloud Internet as I
node "VM GCP
Debian 13" as V

node "Nginx
HTTPS / TLS / Reverse Proxy" as N
node "Frontend
React/Vite build" as FE
node "FastAPI
:8200" as BE
database "Base SQL
cible via DATABASE_URL" as DB
node "n8n
:5678" as N8N
database "Qdrant
:6333" as Q
node "WAHA
:3001" as W
node "Mattermost
:8065" as MM
node "SMSGate API
:3030" as SA
node "SMSGate Web
:3031" as SW

I --> N
N --> FE : jerymotro.duckdns.org
N --> BE : api.jerymotro.duckdns.org
N --> Q : rag.jerymotro.duckdns.org
N --> W : waha.jerymotro.duckdns.org
N --> MM : chat.jerymotro.duckdns.org
N --> N8N : n8n.jerymotro.duckdns.org
N --> SA : api.smsgate.jerymotro.duckdns.org
N --> SW : smsgate.jerymotro.duckdns.org

BE --> DB : SQLAlchemy async
BE --> N8N : HTTP(S) webhooks
BE --> W : HTTP API
BE --> SA : provider SMS

N8N --> DB : accès données feux
N8N --> Q : RAG / connaissance
N8N --> N8N : workflows

note bottom of V
La VM est déclarée sous Debian 13
pour le déploiement de production.
Les ports et domaines ci-dessus
proviennent de conf.ngnix.
end note

@enduml
